  "name": "SPROUTS (Root-Mask-and-Skeletons)",
  "alternateName": "root-mask-and-skeletons",
  "description": "Desktop application (PyQt6 and PyTorch) for plant-root phenotyping from minirhizotron images: model-predicted root masks and skeletons with hand-correction editors, calibrated root area (mm²) and root length (mm) exported as CSV, interactive dashboards, and a multi-class ground-truth tracing tool that exports segmentation training datasets.",
